Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:47:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 14/27] sycl : XMX q8_0 head, FA retune, split-K table, GDN
 state gather, async inputs

Verify-step levers for MTP speculative decoding on Arc B70, all behind
env switches (default off):
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_Q80: XMX q8_0 matmul for 1-8 columns (LM head)
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_FA_V2: FA decode row split at >30 rows, one-wave KV
  chunks, faster combine (bit-identical)
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_KS_V2: split-K table for q4_K 5120x6144, q6_K 5120x17408
- GGML_SYCL_GDN_GATHER: gated-delta reads its state from the cache row
- GGML_SYCL_ASYNC_INPUTS: scheduler-owned pinned ring for graph input
  uploads, event-gated reuse; large inputs stay synchronous
- LLAMA_MTP_DRAFT_SWA / _SINK: sliding window for the MTP draft KV
- GGML_SYCL_GRAPH_MISSLOG and extra LLAMA_HOST_PROF keys

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
